# Icon Asset Registry

When adding or replacing an icon cut:

1. Register the canonical asset under `apps/design-system-portal/public/icons/`.
2. Put semantic monochrome vectors in `icons/svg/`; put transparent colorful business icons in `icons/product/`.
3. Reference the canonical Kit path from prototypes and pages. Do not keep duplicate component-local copies.
4. Ensure “视觉基础 → 图标系统” displays the asset.
5. Do not register backgrounds, avatars, photos, tags, or game-cover artwork as icons.
6. Keep `specs/foundations/icons.yaml` consistent when supported icon formats or usage rules change.
7. Give every new semantic monochrome icon a 24 × 24 canonical frame and use `currentColor` instead of a hard-coded fill or stroke.
8. Default icon components to `color.text.primary`; apply another color only through the semantic Token required by the business state or surface.
